        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented three-bedroom detached bungalow, superbly positioned in The Lynns, Kilsaran, Co. Louth, one of the area’s most sought-after and peaceful residential settings.\r\n\r\nThis attractive modern home offers light-filled, well-proportioned accommodation arranged across one level and is set within mature gardens, enjoying a wonderful sense of privacy and calm in a lovely countryside environment. Despite its peaceful setting, the property remains exceptionally convenient to everyday amenities and enjoys easy access to Kilsaran, Castlebellingham, Annagassan and Dundalk Town Centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged and finished to a high standard throughout. It comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious living room with wood burning stove, bay window and patio doors opening directly to the rear garden. A beautifully fitted kitchen/dining area that provides an excellent space for both family living and entertaining. There are three generous bedrooms, together with a stylish high-quality bathroom and all complemented by a very stylish and exquisitely maintained finish.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is equally impressive, with off-street driveway parking, mature gardens to the front and rear, established trees, manicured lawns and a paved patio area ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation. A detached garage power further enhances the practicality and appeal of this exceptional home.\r\n\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nThe Lynns enjoys a superb location with excellent access to a strong network of local amenities, schools and transport links. \r\n\r\nAnnagassan a charming seaside village is just a short drive away. Well known for its stunning coastal location for sea swimmers, set in the most breathtaking scenic setting and complimented by strong sense of community. The award winning Glyde Inn is one of the area’s best-known landmarks, offering a renowned hospitality venue in an idyllic seaside setting overlooking Dundalk Bay.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by local schools, including Kilsaran National School and St. Finian’s of Dillonstown, adding to the appeal for family buyers seeking a well-connected yet peaceful rural-coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from excellent accessibility to the M1 Dublin/Belfast motorway, providing convenient onward travel to Dublin Airport, Belfast and key cities along the eastern corridor.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis impressive bungalow combines modern comfort, generous outdoor space and a beautiful finish, making it an ideal choice for families, retirees or those seeking quiet country living in a highly desirable Co. Louth setting. Viewing is highly recommended. For all further details, Contact Blue Sky Property on 042-9329333. Guide Price €455,000. \r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
